OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after women report
OL,4,Asexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have been charged
OL,7,Fafter two women reported sexual
OL,8,Fassaults at a property in Mayfair.
OL,10,FVijay Aggarwal, 57, of Brick Street,
OL,11,FMayfair, was charged with four counts
OL,12,Fof sexual assault, the Metropolitan
OL,13,FPolice said.
OL,15,FManpreet Kaur, 41, also of Brick
OL,16,FStreet, was charged with two counts of
OL,17,Fintentionally encouraging or assisting
OL,18,Fthe commission of an either-way
OL,19,Foffence, namely sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
