OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after women report
OL,4,Asexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth defendants appeared at Westminster
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on 13 August and
OL,8,Fwere remanded in custody to appear at
OL,9,FSouthwark Crown Court on 10 September.
